# LoopForge Project Rules

## Stack
- Tauri v2 desktop app: Rust backend + React 19 / TypeScript frontend
- Cargo workspace: `crates/ralph-core` (lib) + `src-tauri` (bin)
- Tailwind CSS 4 with OKLCH design tokens
- SQLite for metadata, filesystem for artifacts
- Zustand for frontend state

## Absolute Rules
- No comments or JSDoc in code
- No single-character variable names
- No eslint-disable directives
- No raw color values (hex, rgb, oklch literals)
- All colors via design token utility classes
- One atomic commit per sub-task
- Commit format: `type(scope): description`
